1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,510
If you have something to say, just say it.

2
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:12,320
What's going on between you two?

3
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:16,650
If this is posted online,

4
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,490
what do you think

5
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:21,160
would happen to Jung Yihyun?

6
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:26,830
Oh.

7
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:29,000
Jung Yihyun...

8
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,960
Since he's a celebrity,

9
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,630
I just hung out with him a few times.

10
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:38,420
He's actually pretty boring.

11
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:47,640
What are you doing?

12
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,000
[Hongseok]

13
00:01:03,850 --> 00:01:05,950
[Park Seonghyeon]

14
00:01:08,850 --> 00:01:10,850
[Shin Yongseok] [Shin Junseop] [Ha Yosep]

15
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:21,450
[Play Me]

16
00:01:26,060 --> 00:01:26,720
Hey!

17
00:01:36,070 --> 00:01:37,440
You really wore it.

18
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:38,690
You told me to wear it.

19
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:42,100
Thanks for preparing this for me.

20
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:44,370
It suits you.

21
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:45,830
You too.

22
00:01:46,530 --> 00:01:47,450
Let's go then.

23
00:01:47,450 --> 00:01:48,289
Okay.

24
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,750
Woah!

25
00:01:55,340 --> 00:01:56,039
See that?

26
00:01:56,039 --> 00:01:57,000
Not bad.

27
00:01:58,050 --> 00:01:59,650
Oh, it's the security guard!

28
00:02:07,220 --> 00:02:08,970
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

29
00:02:11,060 --> 00:02:11,990
Do you remember?

30
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:13,650
[Here are the photos you asked for.]

31
00:03:15,670 --> 00:03:18,579
This is all for Yihyun's own good.

32
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:23,650
[How about reporting a scandal
on the top star Jung Yihyun?]

33
00:03:23,650 --> 00:03:25,950
[Reporter Park Siwan]

34
00:03:31,220 --> 00:03:34,640
It's killing me, rehearsing every day.

35
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:37,440
Emergency! Emergency!

36
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:41,050
[Musical "The Mermaid Prince"
is sold out!]

37
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,050
We're

38
00:03:42,140 --> 00:03:43,190
sold out!

39
00:03:43,190 --> 00:03:45,400
Oh?

40
00:03:57,620 --> 00:04:00,330
What's wrong? Why are you blushing?

41
00:04:00,750 --> 00:04:03,000
Wait, why are you suddenly coughing—

42
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:07,630
We'll get going.

43
00:04:15,140 --> 00:04:16,560
Take care.

44
00:04:20,269 --> 00:04:22,400
Oh, it's a taxi!

45
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:24,400
Bye.

46
00:04:56,020 --> 00:04:57,730
I'll get going too.

47
00:05:00,140 --> 00:05:01,020
Wanna

48
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:03,270
have dinner together?

49
00:05:07,190 --> 00:05:08,070
My treat.

50
00:05:15,700 --> 00:05:16,900
Did they have a fight?

51
00:05:17,330 --> 00:05:18,500
They did look upset.

52
00:05:18,660 --> 00:05:20,540
Guess I was just being paranoid.

53
00:05:22,130 --> 00:05:23,290
Wanna go on a date?

54
00:05:23,290 --> 00:05:24,630
How about a cafe?

55
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:29,130
It's a nice day. Let's go for a walk.

56
00:05:30,340 --> 00:05:36,220
Uh... I forgot I have something to do.

57
00:05:36,220 --> 00:05:37,270
I've to go.

58
00:05:44,730 --> 00:05:46,570
Why did you suddenly ask to meet?

59
00:05:51,450 --> 00:05:53,070
I received this.

60
00:05:56,150 --> 00:05:58,250
[How about reporting a scandal
on the top star Jung Yihyun?]

61
00:05:58,450 --> 00:05:59,790
What the hell?

62
00:05:59,790 --> 00:06:01,580
Someone sent these in,

63
00:06:01,580 --> 00:06:04,630
asking me to expose Jung Yihyun's scandal.

64
00:06:04,630 --> 00:06:05,750
Expose his scandal?

65
00:06:05,750 --> 00:06:07,750
Don't worry, I won't write about it.

66
00:06:08,590 --> 00:06:12,260
I refused, saying I didn't want to
harass a retired actor.

67
00:06:14,970 --> 00:06:17,010
If this is posted online,

68
00:06:17,010 --> 00:06:18,430
what do you think

69
00:06:19,430 --> 00:06:21,030
would happen to Jung Yihyun?

70
00:06:21,230 --> 00:06:23,940
What are you plotting?

71
00:06:23,940 --> 00:06:26,200
Didn't you threaten me with this before?

72
00:06:26,810 --> 00:06:28,110
Back then...

73
00:06:31,530 --> 00:06:32,530
I'm sorry.

74
00:06:35,620 --> 00:06:37,820
I couldn't control my feelings for you,

75
00:06:38,580 --> 00:06:40,750
so I did something I shouldn't have.

76
00:06:42,790 --> 00:06:46,130
It's ridiculous to say this now,

77
00:06:46,130 --> 00:06:48,540
but you and Jung Yihyun drifted apart

78
00:06:49,750 --> 00:06:50,960
because of me.

79
00:06:52,420 --> 00:06:53,300
I'm sorry.

80
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:57,180
What?

81
00:06:57,180 --> 00:06:59,260
The day I threatened you...

82
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:11,030
Jung Yihyun saw us.

83
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:15,700
So I did that on purpose.

84
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:17,820
Eden's never reassured Luka.

85
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:19,370
How could Luka be certain?

86
00:07:19,370 --> 00:07:21,490
If you love someone,
you must find the courage...

87
00:07:21,490 --> 00:07:24,000
Even when he might be betrayed?

88
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:27,880
So...

89
00:07:29,210 --> 00:07:30,290
that's why he...

90
00:07:30,290 --> 00:07:32,550
Be careful.
You might be fine,

91
00:07:32,550 --> 00:07:34,800
but Jung Yihyun could lose everything.

92
00:07:53,730 --> 00:07:55,360
Let's talk.

93
00:08:06,500 --> 00:08:07,160
Be careful.

94
00:08:07,870 --> 00:08:09,210
You might be fine,

95
00:08:09,210 --> 00:08:11,410
but Jung Yihyun could lose everything.

96
00:08:20,850 --> 00:08:22,260
You're a bit late.

97
00:08:25,980 --> 00:08:27,380
Are you not feeling well?

98
00:08:30,350 --> 00:08:30,810
I'm fine.

99
00:08:30,810 --> 00:08:32,440
But you don't look so good.

100
00:08:35,530 --> 00:08:36,650
I'm really fine.

101
00:08:36,650 --> 00:08:38,450
Let's go to the hospital...

102
00:08:41,450 --> 00:08:42,530
Just leave me alone

103
00:08:44,700 --> 00:08:45,450
for a while.

104
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:50,630
I'm sorry.

105
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:07,640
Let's call it a day.

106
00:09:08,180 --> 00:09:09,810
Good work, guys.

107
00:09:09,810 --> 00:09:11,810
I'll head back.

108
00:09:11,810 --> 00:09:13,770
H-Hang on!

109
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:18,190
Um, well...

110
00:09:18,190 --> 00:09:19,700
How about we...

111
00:09:20,900 --> 00:09:22,700
go on a trip together?

112
00:09:22,700 --> 00:09:24,700
What do you say?

113
00:09:24,700 --> 00:09:25,700
The premiere's coming up.

114
00:09:25,700 --> 00:09:28,500
It's a good time to relax
and do some team building.

115
00:09:29,330 --> 00:09:30,750
S-Sounds awesome.

116
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:33,000
I'm in!

117
00:09:36,300 --> 00:09:37,380
Uh,

118
00:09:37,380 --> 00:09:38,170
I...

119
00:09:38,170 --> 00:09:39,970
Agreed.

120
00:09:39,970 --> 00:09:42,510
I think we've rehearsed enough.

121
00:09:42,510 --> 00:09:43,840
Let's set off tomorrow.

122
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,160
-Yes!
-Yes!

123
00:09:47,890 --> 00:09:49,020
You'll join us, right?

124
00:09:49,020 --> 00:09:50,230
I guess.

125
00:09:53,690 --> 00:09:56,190
Wow, the air is so fresh.

126
00:09:57,130 --> 00:09:59,690
I heard there's a really good
scallion pancake place nearby.

127
00:09:59,690 --> 00:10:03,700
How about some scallion pancakes
and rice wine after the hike?

128
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:06,200
Answer me!

129
00:10:06,900 --> 00:10:08,560
My mouth's watering already.

130
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:14,000
Come on, let's go!

131
00:10:24,090 --> 00:10:26,490
You've been looking down since yesterday.

132
00:10:27,350 --> 00:10:28,640
Is something wrong?

133
00:10:31,680 --> 00:10:32,640
Uh, um...

134
00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:37,940
It's nothing.

135
00:10:39,850 --> 00:10:40,940
Okay.

136
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:44,100
If you have anything to say,
you can tell me anytime.

137
00:10:44,530 --> 00:10:45,700
I'll wait for you.

138
00:10:53,710 --> 00:10:54,960
Wait a minute.

139
00:10:56,330 --> 00:10:58,500
It seems faster to go that way.

140
00:10:58,500 --> 00:10:59,960
Jae-on,

141
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:02,010
wanna go scout the path with me?

142
00:11:02,010 --> 00:11:03,840
Yeah, sure.

143
00:11:06,150 --> 00:11:09,020
[Restricted Area; Keep Out]

144
00:11:09,310 --> 00:11:12,390
But...

145
00:11:12,390 --> 00:11:14,060
I don't think this way is it.

146
00:11:14,770 --> 00:11:16,810
Jae-on!

147
00:11:16,810 --> 00:11:19,440
Hold on. I have a call.

148
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:24,650
I'll be right back.

149
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,620
Hey...

150
00:11:35,870 --> 00:11:39,250
Mr. Yoo told me to make sure
Jae-on misses the performance.

151
00:11:40,460 --> 00:11:42,090
Is this really right?

152
00:11:52,390 --> 00:11:53,770
Hey.

153
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:56,190
Wake up.

154
00:11:58,400 --> 00:12:00,270
Kang Jae-on,

155
00:12:00,270 --> 00:12:02,070
don't mess with me, okay?

156
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:06,700
I'm fine!

157
00:12:08,410 --> 00:12:10,070
Got you.

158
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:13,590
Don't joke about things like this.

159
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:21,590
Where are you going?

160
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,130
Are you okay?

161
00:12:26,050 --> 00:12:27,420
Argh...

162
00:12:29,590 --> 00:12:32,590
I played it off only because
I didn't want him to worry.

163
00:12:38,810 --> 00:12:40,740
I should just tell him everything.

164
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:44,570
Was that something to joke about?

165
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:50,860
But he seemed really hurt.

166
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:06,890
Do you remember?

167
00:13:08,420 --> 00:13:10,880
When you were suffering
from a career slump,

168
00:13:11,220 --> 00:13:13,930
we used to drink beer
by Han River every night.

169
00:13:15,810 --> 00:13:17,540
I was really grateful for that.

170
00:13:19,850 --> 00:13:21,310
Thanks to you,

171
00:13:22,350 --> 00:13:24,480
I could take a breather.

172
00:13:26,110 --> 00:13:26,860
I...

173
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:29,740
always felt sorry for you.

174
00:13:31,410 --> 00:13:34,970
You had to be a good son and a good actor,

175
00:13:35,270 --> 00:13:38,200
always trying to
meet others' expectations.

176
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:40,290
You looked really miserable.

177
00:13:46,210 --> 00:13:50,880
So I hoped that at least
when you were with me,

178
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:55,260
you could smile without a care.

179
00:13:58,430 --> 00:14:01,270
Maybe, it was from then on

180
00:14:01,270 --> 00:14:03,350
that I fell for you.

181
00:14:04,860 --> 00:14:07,190
Yihyun,

182
00:14:07,190 --> 00:14:11,240
let's go live in the US together
after this musical ends.

183
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:12,740
I'll treat you even better.

184
00:14:12,740 --> 00:14:14,990
You won't have to do anything.

185
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:23,170
I appreciate it,

186
00:14:24,330 --> 00:14:26,420
but I want to keep doing musicals.

187
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:28,380
Is it because of Kang Jae-on?

188
00:14:29,050 --> 00:14:30,860
Who has always been by your side

189
00:14:30,860 --> 00:14:32,260
and helped you when you broke down?

190
00:14:32,260 --> 00:14:34,390
It was me, not Kang Jae-on!

191
00:14:35,730 --> 00:14:38,260
I know very well
how much you've looked out for me.

192
00:14:38,260 --> 00:14:39,720
I do.

193
00:14:41,100 --> 00:14:43,270
But the one I love is Jae-on.

194
00:14:43,270 --> 00:14:45,400
Do you think
he'll stay by your side forever?

195
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,560
Jae-on...

196
00:14:46,560 --> 00:14:48,230
Since he's a celebrity,

197
00:14:48,230 --> 00:14:50,440
I just hung out with him a few times.

198
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:52,360
Let's go to the hospital...

199
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,740
You've been looking down since yesterday.

200
00:14:54,740 --> 00:14:55,610
Is something wrong?

201
00:14:55,610 --> 00:14:57,780
It's nothing.

202
00:14:58,450 --> 00:15:01,040
I'm the only one
who will love you forever.

203
00:15:01,040 --> 00:15:03,290
You know that too, don't you?
